        "text": "Delete yours. Elon Musk’s companies have received at least $38 billion in U.S. government contracts, loans, subsidies, and tax credits since 2003, with another $11.8 billion projected in the coming years. \n2018: Musk paid $0 in federal income tax due to low realized income and legal deductions. 📷milliondollarthings.com+2",
