    {
      "id": "2117626410529689678",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T14:34:14.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-03 22:34:14",
      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Yes",
      "quote": {
        "author": "TheCaptainEli",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1997753138426613760/EZDpm91Z_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-03 13:35:49",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T05:35:49.000Z",
        "id": "2117490911479263536",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Captain Eli",
        "text": "Most people are still using AI the wrong way.\n\nThey ask it questions.\n\nElon Musk just pointed at the right way.\n\nYesterday, Jason Ginsberg wrote: \"Treat Grok Bot like a teammate and give @bot an ambitious task you'd normally give to a new hire.\"\n\nElon's answer: \"This is the way.\"\n\nThree words. A whole shift in how we work.\n\nHere's what that looks like in real life.\n\nScott Billows runs a business with a very traditional sales cycle. Deals that take months to cultivate.\n\nHe pointed Grok Bot at his company's tools.\n\nIt dug through the past. Surfaced old prospects and customers nobody was calling anymore. Handed them to his sales reps.\n\nTwo weeks in, a closed deal.\n\nHis words: \"Without Grok Bot we most likely would not have reached out to this past customer.\"\n\nThink about that.\n\nNot a faster search. Not a smarter autocomplete. Not a chatbot.\n\nA teammate that found money hiding in plain sight.\n\nEveryone thought AI would be a better answer machine.\n\nIt's actually a new kind of colleague.\n\nElon put it plainly back in October: \"assume you are hiring a super competent employee.\"\n\nNot a tool you open. Someone you hand the job to.\n\nThe team keeps adding powers. Product pages. Order tracking. Payments. Team Bots your whole company can share.\n\nEvery week the job description gets longer.\n\nHere's the part almost nobody sees yet.\n\nFor all of history, having a team was a privilege. Only the rich, the big companies, the well-connected could delegate.\n\nEveryone else did everything alone.\n\nThat wall is falling.\n\nA small shop owner. A single parent. A sailor at sea. Anyone can now say: \"Here's the mission. Go.\"\n\nWhen everyone gets a team, everyone becomes a builder.\n\nAnd a civilization of builders doesn't stay small for long.\n\nStop asking AI questions.\n\nGive it a job.",
        "url": "https://x.com/TheCaptainEli/status/2117490911479263536",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 3260,
        "likes": 14821,
        "quotes": 92,
        "replies": 1048,
        "retweets": 1188,
        "views": 3363224
      },
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2117626410529689678",
      "images": [],
      "media": [],
      "enriched": true
    },
    {
      "id": "2117626333974983007",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T14:33:56.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-03 22:33:56",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "I was at the beach with a couple of friends, and we were all hungry and wanted to find a really good restaurant for dinner\n\nBut we couldn't decide where to go. You know how it is when you're traveling, you end up spending so much time searching through Google trying to find the best place\n\nThen one of my friends said, \"Just ask Grok Bot\"\n\nSo we did, and it literally picked a restaurant nearby for us\n\nWe just had dinner there, and it turned out to be the BEST food we've had since arriving here last night 😂\n\nThe Pad Thai was great, the mango shake was great, and the dessert was absolutely amazing\n\nI'm telling you, Grok Bot is making even the little things in life sooo much easier",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "XFreeze",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1876785200010539008/2_HFJjq9_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-03 21:42:38",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-03T13:42:38.000Z",
